{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207800","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207800","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1720780001:0":{"text":"公主殿下，日安。","source_cn":"公主殿下，日安。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E0A7D8D60C638F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720780002:1":{"text":"苏珊婆婆，请不用多礼。刚才我戴着这枚胸针，好几位公爵夫人都问我是哪位大师的手笔呢。","source_cn":"苏珊婆婆，请不用多礼。刚才我戴着这枚胸针，好几位公爵夫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D60847D5DB4D10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"胸针","source_cn":"胸针","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF50093E34CD6101","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720780003:1":{"text":"咳咳……殿下，您不嫌弃就好。我本来还担心镶嵌得不够完美……","source_cn":"咳咳……殿下，您不嫌弃就好。我本来还担心镶嵌得不够完美……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8C9AD0230939040","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720780004:1":{"text":"在我看来它已经足够完美了。您听，路过的宾客都在赞美它呢！这也是在赞美您。","source_cn":"在我看来它已经足够完美了。您听，路过的宾客都在赞美它呢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE767E71475039CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"sa